# Speed up build context — drop everything the build doesn't need.
# SECURITY 2026-06-04 vuln-test #SC9: explicit secret denies so a dev
# leaving a credential in the workspace doesn't get baked into a layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa
**/id_rsa.*
**/id_ed25519
**/id_ed25519.*
**/.aws/
**/.ssh/
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
infra/helm/**/values*.secret.yaml
infra/helm/**/secrets.yaml

# Build artefacts + non-build files.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/coverage
**/*.log
.git
.github/workflows/measure-real.yml
docs/marketing
docs/_config.yml
scripts
qa
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.gitignore
*.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
**/*.test.ts
